#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Install the Qiskit Runtime client so you can run jobs on IBM quantum "
"computers."
msgstr ""
"Instal Qiskit Runtime client agar kamu bisa menjalankan job di komputer "
"kuantum IBM."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install the Qiskit Runtime client"
msgstr "Instal Qiskit Runtime client"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "{/* cspell:ignore manylinux miniconda */}\n"
msgstr "{/* cspell:ignore manylinux miniconda */}\n"

#. type: Title #
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Install the Qiskit Runtime client {#install-the-qiskit-runtime-client}"
msgstr "Instal Qiskit Runtime client {#install-the-qiskit-runtime-client}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Qiskit Runtime is the cloud-based service for executing quantum computations"
" on IBM Quantum&reg; hardware. This guide shows you how to install `qiskit-"
"ibm-runtime`, which is the client package for accessing the Qiskit Runtime "
"service.\n"
msgstr ""
"Qiskit Runtime adalah layanan berbasis cloud untuk menjalankan komputasi "
"kuantum di hardware IBM Quantum&reg;. Panduan ini menunjukkan cara "
"menginstal `qiskit-ibm-runtime`, yaitu paket client untuk mengakses layanan "
"Qiskit Runtime.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Before installing the Qiskit Runtime client, follow the instructions in "
"these guides:\n"
msgstr ""
"Sebelum menginstal Qiskit Runtime client, ikuti instruksi di panduan-panduan"
" berikut:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "[Install Qiskit](/guides/install-qiskit). \n"
msgstr "[Instal Qiskit](/guides/install-qiskit).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "[Set up your IBM Cloud account](cloud-setup).\n"
msgstr "[Atur akun IBM Cloud-mu](cloud-setup).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Run this command to install Qiskit Runtime:\n"
msgstr "Jalankan perintah ini untuk menginstal Qiskit Runtime:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"Stay current with the latest versions\">\n"
"Periodically check the [Qiskit Runtime release notes](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/release-notes) to see new releases. We recommend frequently updating your requirements for `qiskit-ibm-runtime` by running `pip install -U qiskit-ibm-runtime`.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"Tetap update dengan versi terbaru\">\n"
"Cek secara berkala [catatan rilis Qiskit Runtime](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/release-notes) untuk melihat rilis baru. Kami menyarankan untuk sering memperbarui kebutuhanmu untuk `qiskit-ibm-runtime` dengan menjalankan `pip install -U qiskit-ibm-runtime`.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Next steps {#next-steps}"
msgstr "Langkah selanjutnya {#next-steps}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Recommendations\">\n"
"  - [Install the Qiskit SDK from source](/guides/install-qiskit-source).\n"
"  - [Run your first program](/guides/hello-world).\n"
"  - Try a tutorial, such as [Grover's algorithm](/tutorials/grovers-algorithm).\n"
"  - Review the [deprecation policy](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-ibm-runtime/blob/main/DEPRECATION.md).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Rekomendasi\">\n"
"  - [Instal Qiskit SDK dari sumber](/guides/install-qiskit-source).\n"
"  - [Jalankan program pertamamu](/guides/hello-world).\n"
"  - Coba tutorial, seperti [Algoritma Grover](/tutorials/grovers-algorithm).\n"
"  - Tinjau [kebijakan deprecation](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-ibm-runtime/blob/main/DEPRECATION.md).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
